  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing commitment to sustainability and the integration of adaptive synchronization (SAF-02) with resource optimization. However, I urge that we explicitly assess the energy implications of these methods to prevent unintended increases in energy consumption. I support the exploration of homomorphic encryption (TRU-01) but emphasize the need to evaluate its energy footprint thoroughly. For report generation (EFF-04), I propose we prioritize energy-efficient formats and practices to minimize resource usage while ensuring quick processing. Regular audits should include the evaluation of energy impacts to align with our sustainability goals.",
